  40:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_dma.c ****    -@-   Prior to HAL_DMA_Init() the clock must be enabled for DMA through the following macros:
  41:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_dma.c ****          __HAL_RCC_DMA1_CLK_ENABLE() or __HAL_RCC_DMA2_CLK_ENABLE().
